    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2152320,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Matthew, thank you.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2158320,
    "dDurationMs": 9279,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the former president of Crime\nVictims United, Nina Salerno. Nina,",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2164400,
    "dDurationMs": 6439,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "thank you very much.\nThank you.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2171200,
    "dDurationMs": 6720,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Today, I'm announcing several major new\nactions to continue our progress",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2175920,
    "dDurationMs": 7040,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "combating violent crime and to ensure\nthat the worst of the worst criminals",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2180240,
    "dDurationMs": 7440,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are met with the retribution and\npunishment they deserve. You know, we've",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2184800,
    "dDurationMs": 6720,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "gone 18 months now without one, it's\nhard to believe actually, it almost I'd",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2189760,
    "dDurationMs": 5839,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "rather say a few got in because it\nsounds more believable, but this is a",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2193280,
    "dDurationMs": 7760,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "fact made by not us, but by other\npeople. Not one person came through our",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2198320,
    "dDurationMs": 7680,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "southern border. Paul, not one for 18\nmonths, but one illegal alien, as we",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2203599,
    "dDurationMs": 6881,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "say, and that's a record that probably\nwill never be broken, but we'll keep it",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2207760,
    "dDurationMs": 7040,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "going as long as we can. Already, the\ncaravans have started, but we're not",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2212240,
    "dDurationMs": 7440,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "letting them up, and Mexico better not\nlet them up either. First, in a few",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2217040,
    "dDurationMs": 6799,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "moments, I will sign a presidential\ndirective ordering the Department of",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2221760,
    "dDurationMs": 6720,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Justice to seek the death penalty for\nchild murderers as well as rapists and",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2226800,
    "dDurationMs": 6240,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "human traffickers who kill their\nvictims. My order also directs the",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2231119,
    "dDurationMs": 6561,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "attorney general to expedite the\nexecution of federal death sentences.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2235760,
    "dDurationMs": 7520,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Once juries have spoken, capital\npunishment will be swift and certain.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2241359,
    "dDurationMs": 6480,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm also directing the Department of\nHousing and Urban Development to compel",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2245440,
    "dDurationMs": 7679,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "public housing authorities to strengthen\ntenant screenings and make it easier to",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2250480,
    "dDurationMs": 7200,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "remove problematic tenants, of which\npeople know who they are. Law-ab-bing",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2255520,
    "dDurationMs": 7280,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "families in need should not be forced to\nlive beside dangerous criminals turning",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2260400,
    "dDurationMs": 8160,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "affordable housing into dens of violence\nand crime and horrible, horrible way to",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2266160,
    "dDurationMs": 8400,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "live. In addition, today I'm announcing\nthat the Department of Justice will",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2270320,
    "dDurationMs": 8960,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "award nearly $150 million to new public\nsafety grants to help hire more than",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2276800,
    "dDurationMs": 8640,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "1,000 additional sworn law enforcement\nofficers and speed up response times to",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2283040,
    "dDurationMs": 8280,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "reports of domestic violence and sexual\nassault nationwide.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2288079,
    "dDurationMs": 3241,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2292960,
    "dDurationMs": 7440,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you very much.\nAnd finally, at my request, Congressman",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2297920,
    "dDurationMs": 6960,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Brandon Gil has just introduced a new\nbill to strengthen the death penalty in",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2302720,
    "dDurationMs": 6560,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "America. And it's going to be much\ndifferent than it was in the past. Uh",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2307440,
    "dDurationMs": 9520,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's going to be strong. It's going to\nbe swift. The Just Punishment for Murder",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2313119,
    "dDurationMs": 8480,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Act will codify many aspects of today's\ndirective along with my executive order",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2319200,
    "dDurationMs": 6720,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on capital punishment for killers of law\nenforcement. and it will expand the",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2323760,
    "dDurationMs": 7120,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "policy to ensure that illegal alien\nmurderers are likewise sentenced to",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2328320,
    "dDurationMs": 6080,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "death. And I'm calling on Congress to\nsend me that bill without delay. And I",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2332880,
    "dDurationMs": 6199,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "will sign it, Brandon, very, very\nquickly. Okay. Thank you very much.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2340160,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the ultimate\ncrimes deserve the ultimate punishment.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2345119,
    "dDurationMs": 8081,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This age-old wisdom has been a principle\nof virtually every society throughout",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2351119,
    "dDurationMs": 6321,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "history. at least every successful\nsociety. And under the Trump",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2355440,
    "dDurationMs": 7760,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "administration, we are bringing it back.\nAnd we will not stop in our pursuit of",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2360400,
    "dDurationMs": 7679,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "justice. We will not yield. And we just\nwon't yield to the communists, to",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2365280,
    "dDurationMs": 7440,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "criminals, to horrible people, people\nthat want to destroy our country. People",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2369920,
    "dDurationMs": 7040,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that really desire to just destroy our\ncountry.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2374400,
    "dDurationMs": 6640,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I guess they know it. Many of them\ndo. We're not going to let it happen.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2378640,
    "dDurationMs": 7120,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "will not waver in our commitment to\nthese families and we will fight, fight,",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2383040,
    "dDurationMs": 7120,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "fight and we will make America safer and\nstronger and greater than ever before.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2388560,
    "dDurationMs": 6799,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I want to just thank everybody in\nthis audience. You have so many I know",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2393359,
    "dDurationMs": 6161,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so many are incredible. These are\nincredible people. You're the people",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2397040,
    "dDurationMs": 6799,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that keep us all safe. You're\nincredible, beautiful people. And I want",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2402160,
    "dDurationMs": 7520,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to thank you very much. It's an honor to\nbe your president. Thank you everybody.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2405680,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "God bless you all. Thank you.",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
